            "nvfp4": "the fleet's qsa-fp8-kv patch (myllmbox/sglang-27b-tp2:708f51e-fleet.4) widens only an FP8 pool to the BF16 the SM121 QSA kernel reads (\"unsupported SM121 QSA call: expected BF16 D=256 …\", generation 153); an FP4 pool is not widened",
            "fp4_mx_block16": "the fleet's qsa-fp8-kv patch (myllmbox/sglang-27b-tp2:708f51e-fleet.4) widens only an FP8 pool to the BF16 the SM121 QSA kernel reads (\"unsupported SM121 QSA call: expected BF16 D=256 …\", generation 153); an FP4 pool is not widened"
